      "side": 1,
      "message": "The description should look something like this:\n\n\nANDROID: mm: fix alloc_flags for non-CMA allocations\n\ndd1c26b853 allows movable allocations with __GFP_CMA flags to\nuse CMA. However when setting alloc_flags, __GFP_CMA is not\nbeing considered which leads to __zone_watermark_ok considering\nCMA are as eligible for any movable allocation and wrongly\ninclude NR_FREE_CMA_PAGES into free_pages calculation.\nFix this by setting ALLOC_CMA alloc_flags bit only when\n__GFP_CMA is specified.\n\nFixes: dd1c26b853(ANDROID: GKI: mm: add cma pcp list)\nBug: 221896354\nSigned-off-by: Zhaoyang Huang \u003czhaoyang.huang@unisoc.com\u003e",
      "range": {
